flowchart TB
sources["research: primary-source reading → cited Markdown findings"] --> grill["grill-with-docs / to-spec"]
 questionnaire["to-questionnaire: identify recipient → decisions / facts needed<br/>→ complete questionnaire file"] --> responses["Recipient answers"] --> grill
 grilling["grilling: facts investigated by agent; decision frontier<br/>interviewed in rounds"] --> wrappers["grill-me / grill-with-docs / triage / wayfinder / architecture<br/>survey"]
 domain["domain-modeling: challenge terms; test concrete scenarios<br/>against code;<br/>update GLOSSARY.md; ADR for hard-to-reverse surprising tradeoff"] -.-> wrappers
 deep["codebase-design: small interface, deep behavior, clean seams,<br/>adapters,<br/>dependency injection and observable results"] -.-> tdd["tdd / improve-codebase-architecture"]
 human["Human-only access / credentials / provisioning step"] --> wizard["wizard: interactive Bash procedure with URLs, values and<br/>authorized destinations"] --> resume["Verify procedure and return to blocked workflow"]
 confusion["Message did not land"] --> wait["wait-what: re-pitch missing context in plain glossary language"] --> resume
 teach["teach: persistent learning workspace; assess knowledge and<br/>skill;<br/>lessons, retrieval practice, assets and NOTES.md across sessions"]
 writing["writing-for-agents: context pointers, progressive disclosure,<br/>actionable steps and completion criteria"] -.-> docs["Skills / steering files / agent-consumed documents; retro<br/>improvements"]
 precommit["setup-pre-commit: detect package manager; Husky + lint-staged +<br/>Prettier;<br/>available typecheck / tests; verify hook; commit within<br/>authority"]
 guard["git-guardrails-claude-code: command filter; optional Claude hook<br/>adapter;<br/>other hosts use advisory preflight"]
 shoehorn["migrate-to-shoehorn: agree scope; install dependency;<br/>replace test assertions with fromPartial / fromAny; verify"]
 exercises["scaffold-exercises: parse plan; create numbered variants and<br/>README stubs;<br/>run ai-hero lint; fix until clean; git mv + relint for moves"]
